      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hearing you express this deep yearning for an end is deeply distressing, and I want you to know that your pain is valid. Feeling disconnected from the world while everything else seems to move on can be a terrifying and isolating experience. Please hold on, because your life still holds intrinsic value, even when it feels overwhelmingly dark. If you can, connect with someone immediately by calling a crisis line; there are people who want to help you right now.",
      "source": "target",
